BEGIN:VCALENDAR
VERSION:2.0
PRODID:-//WebMS Intra//Test fixture//EN
X-WEBMS-FIXTURE-NOTE:What this proves: BYSETPOS picking from a whole month, "the last weekday of
X-WEBMS-FIXTURE-NOTE:the month". It only means anything once the month's full list of weekdays
X-WEBMS-FIXTURE-NOTE:exists, so it tests that the list is built before it is narrowed.
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:monthly-setpos-1@fixtures.webms.test
DTSTAMP:20260901T090000Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260930T170000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260930T180000
RRULE:FREQ=MONTHLY;BYDAY=MO,TU,WE,TH,FR;BYSETPOS=-1
SUMMARY:Month-end returns
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
